     2.[0m[2m **Duplicate[0m[2m Charges[0m[2m**: `[0m[2mPaymentGateway[0m[2m`[0m[2m had no[0m[2m idempot[0m[2mency tracking[0m[2m. Ret[0m[2mrying[0m[2m the same[0m[2m `order[0m[2m_id`[0m[2m would charge[0m[2m again[0m[2m.
     
     ###[0m[2m Fixes Applied[0m[2m
     
     **[0m[2m`inventory[0m[2m.py`[0m[2m**
