     -[0m[2m In[0m[2m `charge[0m[2m()`, if[0m[2m an `[0m[2morder_id[0m[2m` was[0m[2m already charged[0m[2m, return[0m[2m `True[0m[2m` immediately[0m[2m without double[0m[2m-charging[0m[2m.
     -[0m[2m Added `[0m[2mwas_ch[0m[2marged(order[0m[2m_id)`[0m[2m helper[0m[2m for[0m[2m callers[0m[2m.[0m[2m
     
     **`[0m[2mcheckout.py[0m[2m`**[0m[2m
     - Re[0m[2mordered[0m[2m the flow[0m[2m to **[0m[2mdecrement[0m[2m inventory first[0m[2m,[0m[2m then charge[0m[2m**:[0m[2m
       1.[0m[2m `inventory[0m[2m.decrement[0m[2m(quantity[0m[2m)` —[0m[2m reserves[0m[2m stock[0m[2m atom[0m[2mically.[0m[2m
